OL,3,AWhat we know so far about Jensen
OL,4,AHuang's affair with suspected Chinese
OL,5,Aspy
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, Huang admitted to having
OL,8,Fbeen "unfaithful" to his wife and
OL,9,Fapologised for hurting her and their
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FUS tech giant Nvidia, one of the most
OL,13,Fvaluable companies in the world, has
OL,14,Fopened an independent investigation
OL,15,Finto the reports. The firm said it does
OL,16,Fnot believe US national security had
OL,17,Fbeen compromised - and added that Huang
OL,18,Fwas committed to continuing to lead the
OL,19,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
